WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
Gunsmoke!

00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:05.620
Are you ready to climb in the saddle and accept the Captain Commando challenge?

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:28.320
And welcome to NEStalgia, a chronological exploration of every NES game released in North America.

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:30.080
I'm Mike. I'm Sean.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:35.260
And I'm Joe. And guys, in other news, the Captain Commando challenge is still around.

