00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:45.220
An extra space between Gun and Smoke.

00:05:45.380 --> 00:05:46.840
Does that count? That makes sense, too.

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:47.820
Or was Gunsmoke one word?

