That's true. So they do come, even in the arcade versions, they come before this.

00:06:57.500 --> 00:07:01.120
So this is clearly like a, let's look at our catalog to get.

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:04.520
Take what we learned. Yeah, take what we learned and we'll see if they learned anything later on.

