Oh yeah. You mean in terms of actual usefulness.

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:18.000
Yeah. Okay. So I meant more sort of like a, like a scoon.

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:19.080
Oh yeah.

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:23.080
Yeah. Where there's an opera inside of it and everything like that.

